(`Result.lean`). At the root

* `x 0` is the Nieuwland number of the polyhedron;
* `x 63, …, x 71` are the entries of the plug's rotation `R₁`, row by row;
* `x 54, …, x 62` are the entries of the hole's rotation `R₂`, row by row;
* `x 72, x 73` are the translation `t`

